Hi,

for OpenMS, please temporarily replace converter call by the following code:

(input is the OpenMS file)
input = MSstatsConvert::MSstatsImport(list(input = input),
                                      "MSstats", "OpenMS")
input = MSstatsConvert::MSstatsClean(input)
annotation = MSstatsConvert::MSstatsMakeAnnotation(input, NULL)

feature_columns = c("PeptideSequence", "PrecursorCharge",  "FragmentIon", "ProductCharge")
input = MSstatsConvert::MSstatsPreprocess(
  input,
  annotation,
  feature_columns,
  remove_shared_peptides = TRUE,
  remove_single_feature_proteins = F,
  feature_cleaning = list(
    remove_features_with_few_measurements = FALSE,
    summarize_multiple_psms = max))
colnames(input)
input[, Fraction := 1]
input = MSstatsConvert::MSstatsBalancedDesign(input, feature_columns, handle_fractions = FALSE)

Answering both questions, I will update MSstats to stop it from removing features in scenarios like this.

Kind regards,
Mateusz

