Hello,

Thank you for pointing out this bug. This was a specific problem for the MaxQ converter when there were multiple modifications. I have pushed a bug fix that will be available on Bioconductor tomorrow (around noon EST). If you want to use the newest version of the package before then you can download it straight from Github <https://github.com/Vitek-Lab/MSstatsPTM>.

I added a new parameter to this converter called `remove_other_mods`. This will give you the ability to keep or remove peptides with modifications that are not of interest (e.g. (Acetyl (Protein N-term))AAAAPDSRVS(Phospho (STY))EEENLK).

Devon

